one design, not optional alternative paths, and the old and new protocols may
not remain as two normal production paths after I3e:

1. **I3a scheduler wave:** add the domain-owned, bounded virtual scheduler
   compiler. Given a unique role-bearing idle-slot set, it selects the same
   assignments and final lane cursors as the named no-interleave sequence of
   current checkouts. Dropping or rejecting the plan is mutation-free. Exact
   falsifiers cover role compatibility, Small-before-Any preservation,
   per-owner fairness, duplicate slots and a changed scheduler cut.
2. **I3b linear completion:** separate lock-external resolve/verify execution
   from authoritative settlement. A worker returns one sealed completion that
   owns the exact settlement evidence and worker slot; execution cannot mutate
   authority. Every completion releases its fair count permit before any
   replacement acquisition, while stale/cancelled work remains a typed bounded
   discharge rather than a service fault.
3. **I3c atomic exchange delta:** compile an immediately available bounded
   completion prefix, virtual post-settlement scheduler/resource state and
   compatible replacement assignments into one domain-specific Plan/Apply.
   Canonical settlement rank, effect-region fit, peer-revocation precedence,
   one Apply stamp, distinct versions and exact capability conservation are
   proved against the executable model. Non-composable work uses the existing
   one-authority cohort planner; no generic transaction or nested undo is
   introduced.
4. **I3d coordinator cutover:** install one `ComputeCoordinator`, one bounded
   completion channel and one capacity-one assignment channel per stable
   worker slot. It drains only completions already available at the first wake,
   never waits to fill a batch, never waits for a permit while a completion is
   pending and has exactly one fair permit waiter only when all pending
   completions are settled. Assignment send failure returns the move-only job
   and runs ordinary cancellation/requeue.
5. **I3e deletion and convergence:** delete per-worker authority checkout,
   settlement retry and role-specific wake loops plus obsolete publication
   branches. Prove the final task/channel/lock/state census, `A + (W + 1) +
   2R` operation-count target, wait-for graph, shutdown capability closure and
   all historical security regressions. Only then mark I3 implemented.

